# Loose binaries and manifests directly in docs/install/ are build output and are not
# versioned. tools/pack_web_install.sh writes neither: everything lands in
# docs/install/<release>/, and that folder IS versioned - GitHub Pages serves /docs
# from the repository, so a manifest its files are not next to would show the picker and
# install nothing. A loose file here means the script changed its layout and this file
# was not told, so it stays ignored rather than silently committed by accident.
docs/install/*.bin
docs/install/manifest-*.json